translate schinese ep9_diks_ph2_zoey_event_label_a68836ee:

    # zo "But I was a bit surprised they didn't know who I was when I told them about you."
    zo "不过我跟他们说起自己和你的关系时，他们居然都不知道我是谁，这让我有点意外。"

